<title>The Rune Programming Language</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/</link><description>An embeddable dynamic programming language for Rust.</description><language>en</language>
<item><title>Rune 0.13</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/rune-0-13-0/</link><guid>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/rune-0-13-0/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the official release of Rune 0.13!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rune is an embeddable dynamic programming language for Rust, it seeks to mimic
the way rust works and is structured. A common way to describe it is &quot;Rust
without types&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-block&quot; data-lang=&quot;rune&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;fn&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;fizzbuzz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token operator&quot;&gt;..=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;up&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
	    &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;match&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token operator&quot;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token operator&quot;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
	    	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;yield&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token string&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;FizzBuzz&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
	    	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;yield&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token string&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Fizz&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
	    	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;yield&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token string&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Buzz&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
	    	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;_&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;yield&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
	    &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;pub&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token keyword&quot;&gt;fn&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;fizzbuzz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token number&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;iter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;collect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token operator&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token ident&quot;&gt;Vec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token operator&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;rune-token punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item>
<item><title>Faster integration tests</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/faster-tests/</link><guid>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/faster-tests/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;This is just a quick post to outline a trick that can be used to speed up
building of projects which has a lot of integration tests.&lt;/p&gt;
</description></item>
<item><title>Fixing a common miscompilation in Rune</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/common-miscompilation/</link><guid>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/common-miscompilation/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;Hopefully it should be no secret that Rune is a young project. And some
shortcuts have been taken when putting together the compiler. One such was how
items and their associated metadata was registered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This particular shortcut happened to be subject to a common source of bugs which
desperately needed to be fixed. So in this post I'll describe the issue in the
hopes that it will be useful to other prospective language authors, and describe
how it was fixed.&lt;/p&gt;
</description></item>
<item><title>This month and a half in Rune</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/tmir1/</link><guid>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/tmir1/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;A bit more than one month ago &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/rust/comments/in67d3/introducing_rune_a_new_stackbased_dynamic/&quot;&gt;I announced Rune&lt;/a&gt; 🥳. And the response so far has
been amazing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A lot of &lt;em&gt;stuff&lt;/em&gt; has happened since then, so in this post I'll detail some of
the developments since the initial announcement.&lt;/p&gt;
</description></item>
<item><title>Hello Internet</title><link>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/hello-internet/</link><guid>https://rune-rs.github.io/posts/hello-internet/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;Less then one month ago &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/rust/comments/in67d3/introducing_rune_a_new_stackbased_dynamic/&quot;&gt;I announced Rune on
Reddit&lt;/a&gt;.
And the response has been amazing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of the issues raised were &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/rune-rs/rune/issues/45&quot;&gt;issue
#45&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Community Site for Rune&lt;/strong&gt;.
This site is an attempt to address that.&lt;/p&gt;
</description></item>
